 "comments": [
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "value": "May act as a transcriptional activator/repressor in the myeloid lineage. Plays a role in the granulocyte/monocyte cell-specific response to interferon. Stimulates the DNA binding of the transcriptional repressor protein YY1"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "value": "Participates in a ternary complex with YY1 and the YY1 target DNA element. Binds nucleolin and nucleophosmin/NPM/B23"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "SUBUNIT"
  },
